quran[6]{c,v,t}:
  3,78,"There is another group of them who twist their tongues while reciting the Book, so you may suppose it to be part of the Book, yet it is not part of the Book. And they say: ‘It is (all) from Allah,’ though it is not from Allah. They attribute lies to Allah, and they know it themselves."
  3,79,"It is not befitting for any human to whom Allah has given the Book, Wisdom, and Prophethood to ever say to people: ‘Be my worshippers instead of Allah.’ Rather (he would say): ‘Be true devotees of the Lord, because you have been teaching the Book, and because you have been studying it.’"
  3,80,And he would never urge you to take the angels and the prophets as lords. Would he call you to disbelief after you have surrendered yourselves to Allah?
  3,81,"(O Esteemed Prophet!) When Allah took a pledge from the prophets, (He said:) ‘Now that I have given you the Book and Wisdom, if there comes to you a Messenger confirming what you have, you must believe in him, and you must help him.’ He said: ‘Do you affirm and accept the burden of My covenant on this condition?’ They said: ‘Yes, we affirm.’ He said: ‘Then bear witness, and I am also among the witnesses along with you.’"
  3,82,"(He said:) ‘Then whoever turns away after that (affirmation), it is they who are the transgressors.’"
  3,83,"Are they seeking a religion other than Allah’s, while everyone in the heavens and the earth has submitted to Him, willingly or unwillingly, and to Him, they shall be returned?"
